recipe.py contains the unchanged SYSTEM_PROMPT, load_model, resolve_class_token_ids
and score_prompt extracted from Tidewall prompt-injection-lora/scripts/eval_finetune_local.py.
Original source commit, file SHA-256 and function hashes are recorded in the
packaged tidewall_lora/recipe-provenance.json. Source repository:
https://github.com/abedegno/prompt-injection-lora
The original
repository and trained model/adapter files are not modified by this package.
Model/adapter licences are retained in their staged directories and manifest.

ensemble.py adapts the class-token scoring recipe in
prompt-injection-ensemble/scripts/inference.py by abedegno (Apache-2.0),
commit b9bc67ae6109a3f7bd1c81f73e218a69acf60f36. The optional Q8 profile
requires separately staged weights; this package does not redistribute them.
Source repository: https://github.com/abedegno/prompt-injection-ensemble

This standalone source distribution was extracted from Tidewall's maintained
OpenAIDR integration candidate. OpenAIDR server, sensors, dashboard, hosted
Intelligence SDK and Git history are not included. Existing inference runtime
and manifests are preserved; test paths and project documentation are adapted
for the standalone repository. See docs/model-scope.md for provenance.
